              "heading": "ZX Bank Ltd. – Salary Saving Account"
            },
            "text": "Welcome to the ZX Bank Salary Saving Account! This specially designed account brings salaried professionals a host of features, flexibility, and exclusive benefits. Discover everything you need to know about account features, the application process, minimum balance requirements, and the exclusive Savings Account Kit you receive upon opening your account."
          }
        ],
        "sections": [
          {
            "title": "Salary Saving Account Features",
            "level": 2,
            "location": {
              "line": 7,
              "heading": "ZX Bank Ltd. – Salary Saving Account"
            },
            "blocks": [
              {
                "type": "list",
                "location": {
                  "line": 9,
                  "heading": "Salary Saving Account Features"
                },
                "ordered": false,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "text": "Zero Balance Facility: No need to maintain a minimum balance — enjoy complete convenience.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Instant Account Opening: Open your account instantly via digital onboarding or at any branch.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Free Debit Card: Complimentary international debit card for secure and easy transactions.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Auto Sweep Fixed Deposit: Automatic transfer of surplus funds into Fixed Deposits for higher returns.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Unlimited Fund Transfers: Free and unlimited fund transfers via IMPS, NEFT, RTGS, and UPI.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Preferential Loan Rates: Special interest rates on personal loans, home loans, and car loans.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Bill Payments & Recharge: Pay utility bills and recharge mobile/DTH instantly via the ZX Bank app.",
                    "depth": 0
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "AI-powered Banking Assistant: 24x7 help from Zia, your smart banking assistant.",
                    "depth": 0
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "sections": []
          },
